'''Way Big''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[To'kustar (Classic)|To'kustar]], a race of gigantic aliens that are created during unpredictable [[Cosmic Storm|cosmic storms]].{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}{{Refn|[[:File:Cosmic Storm Proof.png]]|group = pop-up|name = cosmic}}<ref name="SotO" />

==Appearance==
===Ben as Way Big===
Way Big is a roughly 100 feet<ref>[[Azmuth's Father]]</ref><ref name="DAA">'''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]'''''</ref>{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}{{Refn|[[:File:WayBig.png]]|group = CN}}{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big Bandai Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = card}}{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big Top Trumps Card.png]]|group = TT}}{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: The Complete Guide]]''; [[:File:WayBig AlienForce.png|page 53]]|group = guide}}{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Alien Force: The Complete Guide]]''; [[:File:Vilgax Merchandise.png|page 74]]|group = guide}}{{Refn|group = note|One source incorrectly claimed that Way Big is 200 feet tall,{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big 200 Feet Tall.png]]|group = annual|name=height}} while [[Matt Wayne]] mentioned that Way Big was 120 feet tall.{{Refn|group = MW|''link unavailable''}}}} (approximately 30 meters) tall humanoid creature with white skin. He has a large frill on his head, which is black at the front and red at the bottom. He has blade-like growths on his shoulders and spikes on his waist. He also has red arms with three black lines and white fins on the elbows, wristband-like outgrowths on his wrists and yellow eyes on his head with two extra eyes protruding on his cheeks, one on each.{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big Cheek Eyes Proof.png]]|group = TNP}} He has red feet with two toes, a black sandal-like covering on the middle of his feet and three black lines on the side of his neck. The red parts of Way Big's body are made of an unknown cosmic material with metallic properties.<ref name="SP2">''[[Showdown: Part 2]]''</ref>{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big Unknown Cosmic Metal.png]]|group = DJW}}

In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Way Big was a little bigger than he was in the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Highbreed Repair Wave Range.png]]|group = DM}} His head frill was red on the front and black on the bottom, his arms were white with red fins coming out of them and his neck and wrists were black. Way Big's eyes are green and he did not bear the extra ones on his cheeks. He lacked the stripes on his arms as well as the blades on his shoulders and waist. He also had red boot-like feet and did not have the sandal-like coverings. Kevin as Way Big is identical to this design.

In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens|Destroy All Aliens]]''''', Way Big looked mostly the same as in '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''', except the red parts were colored to match his portrayal in the '''Original Series'''.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Way Big has two red lines on his neck, the blades on his shoulders and waist have returned and are red and he also has black fingerless gloves, similar to the ones [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] wears in the same series. He is now more muscular, his head is less skull-shaped and has eyes on his cheeks again, which are more metallic. The fins on his arms are longer and he has regained the stripes on his arms and legs, and the wristband-like outgrowths on his wrists. Both 16 and 11-year-old Way Big share the exact same design with the exception of the ring around the Omnitrix symbol, which is silver in the 11-year-old version and white in the 16-year-old version.

Way Big wears the [[Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

===Ben 10,000 as Way Big===
[[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]]'s Way Big is practically identical to his '''Original Series''' design, with the only supposed difference being that Ben 10,000's Way Big has thicker lips.

===Mad Ben as Mad Way Big===
[[Mad Ben|Mad Ben's]] Way Big is near identical to Ben Prime's Way Big in '''Omniverse''', except for orange replacing the eyes and the red parts. He also wears gray shoulder pads with orange spikes, spiked shoes, and orange wraps around his forearms and calves. His arm and head blades are also serrated.

===Azmuth as Evil Way Big===
[[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] as Evil Way Big<ref>[[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]</ref>{{Refn|group = credits|[[:File:2DAA (1969).png]]}}<ref name="DAA"/> looks identical to Way Big's appearance in [[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens|the film]] except the red parts of his body are recolored blue, the white parts recolored grey, his eyes recolored red, and the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] symbol replaced with a red circle with a silver rim.

