BaDGtMS (238).png|Enhanced Strength
Way Big Shock Wave.png|Shock Wave Generation (via Enhanced Strength)
TFoW2 (382).png|Enhanced Durability
SD2 (250).png|Enhanced Jumping
TFoW2 (383).png|Enhanced Acrobatics
TWG (392).png|Enhanced Speed
TWG (402).png|Water Vortex Generation (via Enhanced Speed)
TFoW2 (438).png|Enhanced Reflexes
</gallery> 
Way Big is one of Ben's most powerful aliens. He was considered Ben's most powerful alien before the appearance of [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]].{{Refn|group = annual|name=height}}

Way Big can shoot a powerful cosmic ray{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big Cosmic Rays.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|Way Big's cosmic rays were colored pale blue in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' and green in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''. Meanwhile, alternate versions of Way Big are shown firing cosmic rays in different colors. For example, [[Mad Ben]]'s Way Big fires orange cosmic rays.<ref name="IaMMMBWP2" />|group=note}} from the outer edge of his right hand by crossing his arms together.{{Refn|In '''Ultimate Alien''', Way Big's cosmic ray attack was executed by crossing his arms in an "L" shape, with his right forearm vertical and left forearm horizontal in front of it and the thumb edge of his hands facing his body. In '''Omniverse''', Way Big now crosses his arms in an "X" shape.|group=note}} His cosmic rays are powerful enough to disintegrate a small planet.{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big trivia.png]]|group = DM}} [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] learned this ability by practicing as Way Big.{{Refn|[[:File:How Ben Learned To Use Way Big's Cosmic Rays.png]]|group = DM}}

Way Big is very strong, being able to hurl targets into orbits from planets with an atmosphere as thick as [[Earth (Classic)|Earth's]],{{Refn|[[:File:Gravattack Structural Limit.png]]|group = MW}} as shown when he threw [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] (who was Way Big's size at the time) into orbit from [[Primus]].<ref name="Primus">''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]''</ref> He can even lift objects larger and heavier than him, as he managed to lift the [[Hyperspace Jump Gate]].<ref name="WotWP1">''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]''</ref> Way Big is also powerful enough to generate massive tremors similar to a 7.0 earthquake by stomping his feet.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = card}}

Way Big has great durability, being able to withstand attacks from strong opponents his size, such as the [[Trash Monster]],<ref name="TWG">''[[The Widening Gyre]]''</ref> a giant [[Trombipulor]],<ref name="BaDGtMS">''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]''</ref> a giant [[Malware]]<ref name="SP2" /> and several [[Way Bad]]s.<ref name="TFoWP2" />

Way Big can jump very high.<ref name="SP2" /> He also has extremely quick reflexes, being able to react to [[Milleous]]' Incursean Conquest Ray.<ref name="TFoWP2">''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]''</ref>

Way Big possesses enhanced speed, being able to run fast enough to generate a massive vortex that was powerful enough to launch the Trash Monster (which was as big as Way Big) out of orbit.<ref name="TWG" />{{Refn|According to [[Derrick J. Wyatt]], Way Big's enhanced speed was due to a glitch with the original Ultimatrix. This ability was removed from Way Big's DNA when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] acquired the new Omnitrix in ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]''.{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big Speed Glitch.png]]|group = DJW}} However, it is unknown if this is canon as [[Matt Wayne]] seemed to be unaware of the existence of glitch powers.{{Refn|http://archive.is/A42xJ|group = MW}}|group = note}} Way Big also has a massive stride, so he can get to his destination quicker than other aliens.{{Refn|[[:File:Way Big's Speed.png]]|group = DJW}}

Way Big can survive in the vacuum of space and in extreme temperatures, either hot or cold.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = card}}

===Non-Canon Powers and Abilities===
====Cosmic Destruction====
Way Big can create cosmic explosions.

Way Big is able to manipulate [[Cosmic Storm|cosmic storm]]s, allowing him to generate lightning and vortexes.

Way Big is also able to levitate using cosmic storms.

Way Big can use his cosmic storms to propel himself and travel through outer space much faster than light.

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
2DAA (1593).png|Vulnerable Head Frill/Electricity Vulnerability
TFoW1 (90).png|Unintentional Size Damage
IaMBW2 (394).png|Ambushed by Small Enemies
</gallery>
The frill on Way Big's head is by far his greatest weakness, as attacking it will cause him great pain and stun him.<ref>[[Tetrax Shard (Classic)|Tetrax Shard]]</ref><ref name="DAA"/>

Because of Way Big's massive size, the person transformed as him can be clumsy with their surroundings and accidentally cause property damage, by knocking into or leaning against things.<ref>''[[Simple]]''</ref><ref>''[[The Frogs of War: Part 1]]''</ref>

Smaller opponents such as [[Nanomech]] can take advantage of Way Big's large size and attack him without noticing, as demonstrated when Nanomech entered Way Big's ear and began attacking him from inside, immediately incapacitating him.<ref name="IaMMMBWP2">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]''</ref>

Way Big is vulnerable to powerful discharges of electricity, such as that of the [[Mechamorph Armor]] and the [[Hyperspace Jump Gate]].<ref name="DAA" /><ref name="WotWP1" />

Way Big can be rendered unconscious if hit by many sedative quills from a member of [[Argit]]'s [[Argit's Species|species]].<ref name="TFoWP2" />

Way Big can be controlled by [[Vladat]]s via their [[Corruptura]]s.{{Refn|[[:File:Whampire Can Control a To'kustar.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Ben 10===
*Way Big first appeared in '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix]]''''', where he was unlocked by [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]], destroyed [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s [[Mechadroid|army]], and threw Vilgax into space.
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]''''', Way Big appeared twice. Firstly, Way Big asked for [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben's]] homework in a dream. Then, Way Big battled Evil Way Big.

===Five Years Prior to Omniverse===
*In ''[[Special Delivery]]'', Way Big defeated [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]] and his [[Mutant Mosquito|mosquito creature]].
**The same scene reoccurred on a screen in ''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]''.
*In ''[[From Hedorium to Eternity]]'', Way Big survived a massive fall and stopped [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]], [[Lucy Mann|Lucy]], and [[Jonesy]] from falling.

===Alien Force=== 
*Way Big was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.
*In ''[[War of the Worlds: Part 1]]'', Way Big was re-unlocked by the Master Control, and failed to destroy a [[Hyperspace Jump Gate]] to stop the [[Highbreed]].
*In ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]'', Way Big was one of the aliens who escaped from the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]]. He was lured back to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] by [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]], where the Omnitrix reabsorbed him.
*In ''[[Simple]]'', Way Big managed to stop the war between the red and blue armies by accidentally destroying the statue of [[Zavin]], resulting in them both teaming up against him.
*In ''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]'', Way Big defeated a giant [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Video Games (Episode)|Video Games]]'', Way Big crushed the [[Stalker]] and [[Will Harangue|Will Harangue's]] car.
*In ''[[Absolute Power: Part 1]]'', Way Big defeated [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]].
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Way Big tried to destroy the [[Hands of Armageddon]] with his cosmic ray and the help of [[Ultimate Ben]], who used [[Clockwork|Clockwork's]] powers but was destroyed by [[Eon|Eon's]] time ray. After Eon was defeated, however, Way Big was restored by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].
*In ''[[The Perfect Girlfriend]]'', Way Big destroyed two [[Living Building|monster buildings]] created by [[Elena Valadis|Elena]].
*In ''[[The Ultimate Sacrifice]]'', Way Big battled the [[Ultimate Forms#Sentient Forms|Sentient Ultimate forms]], but eventually timed out.
*In ''[[The Widening Gyre]]'', Way Big fought the [[Trash Monster]] and threw it into the sun by creating a water vortex.
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Way Big appeared as one of the many aliens when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was explaining his story to [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].
*In ''[[Inspector 13]]'', Kevin as Way Big prepared to break into the [[Techadon Factory]] before being switched into [[Nanomech]].
*In ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]'', Way Big went [[Ultimate Way Big|Ultimate]] to battle [[Dagon]].

===Omniverse===
*In ''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]'', Way Big was defeated by a giant [[Trombipulor]], forcing him to switch into [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]].
*In ''[[Showdown: Part 2]]'', Way Big battled [[Malware]] before being absorbed by him.
*In ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 1]]'', Way Big saved some people from a sign that he accidentally knocked over before the Randomizer switched him into [[NRG]].
*In ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]'', Way Big battled the [[Way Bad]]s and destroyed [[Milleous|Emperor Milleous]]' ship.
*In ''[[Universe vs. Tennyson]]'', Way Big defeated Trombipulor by stepping on him.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Way Big appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===
*In ''[[Ken 10]]'', Way Big punched [[Kevin 11,000]] into the ground out of anger after he hurt [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]].

===Mad Ben's Timeline===
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]'', Mad Way Big battled [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] and [[Lightning Volt]], but was defeated by [[Nanomech]].

